      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Oh, doctor, I've done my back. Lifting a patient at work, a big chap, he slipped, and I caught him, and something went in my lower back. It's been three days. I'm a nurse, I should know better, and my mum says it's because I never stretch.",
